# Playwright run artifacts. Traces and videos can contain screenshots of a
# running deployment, so they are ignored by pattern here rather than relying on
# whoever adds the next reporter to remember.
node_modules/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
test-results/
.playwright/

# The throwaway loopback certificate the desktop-target stub backend serves
# (PL-0501, round 45). Minted per run by `src/tls.ts`; never committed. The
# repository root also ignores `*.pem` and `*.key` by pattern, so this entry is
# belt and braces rather than the only thing standing between a private key and
# version control.
.tls/
